       "Rerank cache: `/Users/paolo.bonicco/Library/Mobile Documents/com~apple~CloudDocs/Università/Tesi/agentic-legal-rag-suite/data/cache/rerank/slurm.gpt-oss_120b.jsonl`; hits=61, misses=0"
